<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>Someone (hopefully you) asked to sign in to coordination.tools as <%= @user.email %>.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Sign in to coordination.tools", @confirm_url %></p>
<p>This link works for 30 minutes and signs in whichever browser opens it, so open it on the device you want to use.</p>
<p>If you didn't request it, you can ignore this email — nothing changes unless the link is clicked.</p>
